{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fjqeENxmWq1795095258.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名男子下午在西貢踩單車跌倒，昏迷送東區醫院搶救。</p><p></p><p>71歲男子由政府飛行服務隊，送往東區醫院。事發在下午近4時半，警方接獲報案指，一名男子踩單車由榕樹澳往深涌碼頭，臨近碼頭時突然仆倒，面部流血、昏迷送院。</p><p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:38:45.713704+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T13:57:16.410877+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:04.660474+00:00","content_hash":"c557147b03c2992e5cf5072d092c37858d319415f9a7857b4298004d8dc252d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:38:45.713704+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}